        <briefdescription>
<para>Acquire load of an alive-bit word, pairing with the release fetch_or in <ref refid="namespaceecss_1_1Memory_1_1Sector_1a26358a3fb6eceaa40f97bcf3384d8321" kindref="member">Sector::markAlive&lt;true&gt;</ref>: a reader seeing a set bit is guaranteed the component bytes written before it. x86-64: plain MOV. ARM64: LDAR instead of LDR. </para>
        </briefdescription>
